body:
@OsirisTerje I forgot to mention...

The initial setting to `Off` should be happening internally, without any call on your part. That's why, for example, most runners don't include the `Off` setting in their packages. I'm not sure if this is happening in all instances of `InternalTrace` however.

In the case of the framework, the correct behavior occurs without actually changing the value from `Default` to `Off` by use of the `>` comparison.
